    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Overview:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion: Phoenix is a passion project by a solo developer and lifelong gamer eager to bring back the glory days of video gaming. An alien empire hellbent on conquering Earth has arrived at our doorstep, and humanity is in total anarchy. Delve into this meticulously crafted 2D top-down pixel art RTS and sign up with the Earthen Union to take back Earth from the clutches of the Zyrex Empire. Or, will you instead join the Empire and fight to crush humanity under your boots? The choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With custom matches available now, and a roadmap promising expansive campaigns and thrilling updates, Invasion: Phoenix vows to revitalize the RTS genre wish a dash of sci-fi magic. Earth hangs in the balance; can you save it, or will you enslave it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/9badea07c014d97ef4ae539f36be8c60.poster.avif?t=1751356126\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/9badea07c014d97ef4ae539f36be8c60.webm?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/9badea07c014d97ef4ae539f36be8c60.mp4?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key Features:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singular Vision, Limitless Ambition:</strong>\u00a0The culmination of a lifetime of passion and unwavering commitment brings to life a brand new universe  teeming with intrigue and possibility. Return to the glory days of gaming where fun comes first, and get lost in the experience. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Campaigns on the Horizon:</strong> Anticipate the unveiling of single player campaigns for the Earthen Union and Zyrex Empire. Destroy your enemies and claim Earth as your own across a variety of missions and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Diverse Arsenal at Your Command:</strong> Assume control of units inspired by the vast expanse of science fiction, ranging from the conventional Earth military hardware, to the terror-inducing Zyrex Empire, to the bleeding-edge technology of the Coalition of Life. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devastating Combat Powers:</strong> Harness devastating combat powers unique to each faction, from precision airstrikes and tactical mercenary deployments, to the terrifying fury of orbital lasers. Seize control of the battlefield with strategic might and unleash chaos upon your adversaries. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay Environments:</strong> Immerse yourself in 8 distinct custom match game modes, encompassing a variety of classic game types such as Capture the Flag and deathmatch, alongside innovative additions such as Terror mode. Lay waste to 16 unique maps and tailor your experience further with customizable weather and  toggle options, ensuring endless variety and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/d1b9802100b8a25cc5d4c1edaeb877c5.poster.avif?t=1751356126\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/d1b9802100b8a25cc5d4c1edaeb877c5.webm?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/d1b9802100b8a25cc5d4c1edaeb877c5.mp4?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Lore:</strong> Immerse yourself in a galaxy steeped in history and mystery, supported by an extensive collection of codex entries that peel back the layers of Invasion: Phoenix's enigmatic narrative and reveal a much larger story.  Prepare yourself for a journey of discovery that transcends the confines of the game itself, and opens the door to a compelling new universe that will be explored in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Lose yourself in the captivating melodies and atmospheric soundscapes of Invasion: Phoenix, crafted with care and attention to detail. Full voice acting, a sound effect and ambience library, and a playlist of original music transports you to the heart of the conflict and gets you in the mood to destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tutorial:</strong> Tutorial mode now released, simultaneously giving you a taste of what the future campaign mode will have in store, while also training you on strategic combat that you can use to bring the fight to the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access:</strong> Embrace the opportunity to shape the destiny of Invasion: Phoenix in its early access phase. Engage in custom matches today, and stand at the ready for the release of updates and campaign mode that promise to expand the game's horizons, and revitalize the RTS genre.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/7334ef6e8dbb3528e6cd268e9ee3ff50.poster.avif?t=1751356126\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/7334ef6e8dbb3528e6cd268e9ee3ff50.webm?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/7334ef6e8dbb3528e6cd268e9ee3ff50.mp4?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Join the War Now:</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to heed the call and carve your name into galactic legend? Embrace the challenge and embark on a journey that will test your mettle and redefine your perceptions of gaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/a7b153b41b7ce9692759f55a6b911a61.poster.avif?t=1751356126\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/a7b153b41b7ce9692759f55a6b911a61.webm?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/a7b153b41b7ce9692759f55a6b911a61.mp4?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
