6126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Lore:</strong> Immerse yourself in a galaxy steeped in history and mystery, supported by an extensive collection of codex entries that peel back the layers of Invasion: Phoenix's enigmatic narrative and reveal a much larger story.  Prepare yourself for a journey of discovery that transcends the confines of the game itself, and opens the door to a compelling new universe that will be explored in the future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Lose yourself in the captivating melodies and atmospheric soundscapes of Invasion: Phoenix, crafted with care and attention to detail. Full voice acting, a sound effect and ambience library, and a playlist of original music transports you to the heart of the conflict and gets you in the mood to destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Tutorial:</strong> Tutorial mode now released, simultaneously giving you a taste of what the future campaign mode will have in store, while also training you on strategic combat that you can use to bring the fight to the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access:</strong> Embrace the opportunity to shape the destiny of Invasion: Phoenix in its early access phase. Engage in custom matches today, and stand at the ready for the release of updates and campaign mode that promise to expand the game's horizons, and revitalize the RTS genre.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/7334ef6e8dbb3528e6cd268e9ee3ff50.poster.avif?t=1751356126\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/7334ef6e8dbb3528e6cd268e9ee3ff50.webm?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/7334ef6e8dbb3528e6cd268e9ee3ff50.mp4?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Join the War Now:</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you prepared to heed the call and carve your name into galactic legend? Embrace the challenge and embark on a journey that will test your mettle and redefine your perceptions of gaming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/a7b153b41b7ce9692759f55a6b911a61.poster.avif?t=1751356126\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/a7b153b41b7ce9692759f55a6b911a61.webm?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952520/extras/a7b153b41b7ce9692759f55a6b911a61.mp4?t=1751356126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
